WEBVTT

00:00:18.480 --> 00:00:19.760
(BEEPING)

00:00:22.720 --> 00:00:24.720
COMPUTER: This message
will self-destruct.

00:00:24.800 --> 00:00:25.880
Uh-oh.

00:00:26.120 --> 00:00:28.360
(MUFFLED EXPLOSION, COUGHING)

00:00:28.680 --> 00:00:30.360
(FIRE ALARM BEEPING)

00:00:32.280 --> 00:00:34.600
(FAMILY SHOUTING
IN ANOTHER ROOM)

00:00:43.960 --> 00:00:46.640
You are one
distracted guy.

00:00:46.720 --> 00:00:48.560
Am I?
I don't mean to be.

00:00:48.640 --> 00:00:54.320
I know you miss being a hero
and your job is frustrating.

00:00:54.440 --> 00:00:56.960
I just want you
to know how much
it means to me

00:00:57.040 --> 00:00:59.080
that you stay
at it anyway.

00:00:59.160 --> 00:01:01.800
Honey? About the job?
What?

00:01:01.880 --> 00:01:04.080
Something's happened.
What?

00:01:04.160 --> 00:01:05.840
The, uh...
What?

00:01:05.960 --> 00:01:08.560
The company is sending me
to, uh, a conference.

00:01:08.640 --> 00:01:09.640
A conference?

00:01:09.720 --> 00:01:10.840
(STAMMERING)
Out of town.

00:01:10.920 --> 00:01:12.400
I'm gonna be gone
for a few days.

00:01:12.480 --> 00:01:15.720
They've never sent you
to a conference before.

00:01:15.800 --> 00:01:17.000
This is good,
isn't it?

00:01:17.120 --> 00:01:18.160
(HESITATING) Yes.

00:01:18.240 --> 00:01:21.320
You see? They're finally
recognizing your talents.

00:01:21.440 --> 00:01:22.920
You're moving up.
Yes.

00:01:23.000 --> 00:01:25.000
Honey!
This is wonderful!

00:01:25.120 --> 00:01:26.160
Yes, it is.

00:01:26.520 --> 00:01:28.000
(PHONE RINGING)

00:01:28.240 --> 00:01:29.520
(OVER PHONE) Hello?

00:01:29.600 --> 00:01:31.560
This is Mr. Incredible.

00:01:32.360 --> 00:01:33.520
I'm in.

00:01:39.560 --> 00:01:43.760
The Omnidroid 9000
is a top secret
prototype battle robot.

00:01:43.840 --> 00:01:47.280
Its artificial intelligence
enables it to solve
any problem

00:01:47.360 --> 00:01:50.280
it's confronted with.
And, unfortunately...

00:01:50.360 --> 00:01:51.360
Let me guess.

00:01:51.560 --> 00:01:53.920
It got smart enough
to wonder why it had
to take orders.

00:01:54.000 --> 00:01:55.360
We lost control.

00:01:55.480 --> 00:01:56.800
Now it's loose
in the jungle,

00:01:56.880 --> 00:01:58.040
threatening
our facility.

00:01:58.360 --> 00:02:01.280
We've had to evacuate
all personnel from the
island for their own safety.

00:02:01.360 --> 00:02:02.360
How am I going in?

00:02:02.680 --> 00:02:06.360
The Omnidroid's defenses
necessitate an air drop
from 5,000 feet.

00:02:06.440 --> 00:02:09.840
Its cloaking devices
make it difficult to track.

00:02:09.920 --> 00:02:13.040
We're pretty sure
it's on the southern
half of the island.

00:02:13.160 --> 00:02:17.120
One more thing.
Obviously it represents
a significant investment.

00:02:17.240 --> 00:02:19.560
You want me
to shut it down
without destroying it.

00:02:20.360 --> 00:02:22.240
You are Mr. Incredible.

00:02:41.240 --> 00:02:43.920
I've got to warn you,
it's a learning robot.

00:02:44.000 --> 00:02:47.720
Every moment you fight it
increases its knowledge
of how to beat you.

00:02:47.800 --> 00:02:50.000
Shut it down.
Do it quickly.
Don't destroy it.

00:02:50.080 --> 00:02:51.920
And don't die.

00:02:52.160 --> 00:02:53.600
Great. Thanks.

00:03:07.760 --> 00:03:09.600
(GRUNTING)

00:03:23.840 --> 00:03:25.280
Showtime.

00:03:26.120 --> 00:03:28.120
(BIRD AND INSECT NOISES)

00:03:30.760 --> 00:03:32.920
(PANTING HEAVILY, SIGHING)

00:03:50.800 --> 00:03:52.320
(FLY BUZZING)

00:04:10.320 --> 00:04:11.400
Huh?

00:04:13.240 --> 00:04:14.960
Hmm.
(LOUD CRASH)

00:04:18.520 --> 00:04:19.960
(CRIES OUT IN PAIN)

00:04:26.760 --> 00:04:27.800
(SATISFIED GRUNT)

00:04:30.360 --> 00:04:31.440
Uh-oh.

00:05:25.920 --> 00:05:27.400
(SCREAMING WITH EFFORT)

00:05:30.400 --> 00:05:32.240
(LAUGHING, LOUD CRACK)

00:05:33.160 --> 00:05:34.720
Oh, my back!

00:05:55.960 --> 00:05:57.280
(LOUD CRACK)
Oh!

00:06:42.640 --> 00:06:45.920
Surprising.
We must bring him back.

00:06:46.000 --> 00:06:49.840
Sound the all clear,
and invite him to dinner.

